148	/// A platform to traverse the revision graph by adding starting points as well as points which shouldn't be crossed,
149	/// returned by [`Repository::rev_walk()`].
150	///
151	/// **Note that we automatically leverage the commitgraph data structure**, but if you know that additional information like
