  "criterion": "For each of the 18 triples callisto_graph::napi::triple_to_role recognises, every PlatformTarget produced for that triple has exactly the following hostRunner and useCross values (matching the design doc's per-platform-family rule at .claude/specs/callisto-matrix.md section 3.1, corrected for the triples that actually exist in code): aarch64-apple-darwin -> (\"macos-latest\", false); x86_64-apple-darwin -> (\"macos-13\", false); x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", false); x86_64-unknown-linux-musl -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", true); aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", true); aarch64-unknown-linux-musl -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", true); x86_64-pc-windows-msvc -> (\"windows-latest\", false); i686-pc-windows-msvc -> (\"windows-latest\", false); aarch64-pc-windows-msvc -> (\"windows-latest\", false); armv7-unknown-linux-gnueabihf -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", true); x86_64-unknown-freebsd -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", true); aarch64-linux-android -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", true); armv7-linux-androideabi -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", true); riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", true); powerpc64le-unknown-linux-gnu -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", true); s390x-unknown-linux-gnu -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", true); wasm32-wasip1 -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", false); wasm32-unknown-unknown -> (\"ubuntu-latest\", false). This table is implemented as a table-driven unit test asserting all 18 pairs in one test function.",
  "is_error_case": false
},
{
  "id": "AC-013",
  "criterion": "For every PlatformTarget produced by callisto matrix, artifactName equals the literal string \"native-\" concatenated with the triple field, e.g. triple \"aarch64-apple-darwin\" produces artifactName \"native-aarch64-apple-darwin\".",
  "is_error_case": false
},
{
  "id": "AC-014",
  "criterion": "For every PlatformTarget whose platform is one of darwin, freebsd, android, or wasi/unknown-with-wasm32-arch, the JSON output's abi field is null (not the string \"null\", not omitted); for win32-platform targets the abi field is likewise null (never \"msvc\"); for linux-platform targets abi is a non-null string matching the abi derived from triple_to_role's ManifestRole::Platform for that triple.",
  "is_error_case": false
},
{
